            0.108,
            0.087,
            0.775,
            0.173
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "You have also learnt in the earlier grades that all objects radiate heat. We feel hot inside a concrete house at night especially during hot summer, this is due to the heat re-radiated by the concrete during the night. However, traditional houses built with thick mud and wooden walls offer cool conditions even in hot summer due to less re-radiation."
            }
          ]
        },
